    "使った期間とコストを見える化して、\n納得できる買い替え時期を考えられます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look back at how long you've owned it and what it costs, then decide when you're ready to replace it."
